{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pepgent/soroi/pulls/266","id":5104508252,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUW8ics8AAAABMECdXA","html_url":"https://github.com/Pepgent/soroi/pull/266","diff_url":"https://github.com/Pepgent/soroi/pull/266.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Pepgent/soroi/pull/266.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pepgent/soroi/issues/266","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pepgent/soroi/pulls/266/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pepgent/soroi/pulls/266/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pepgent/soroi/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pepgent/soroi/issues/266/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pepgent/soroi/statuses/99d8ed1a90e4f7561e47e296ae3b42c8595d2cd6","number":266,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"接通正式发行 A0 的 prepare 与公开启动路径","user":{"login":"RiriAgent","id":39219425,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MjE5NDI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39219425?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiriAgent","html_url":"https://github.com/RiriAgent","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiriAgent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiriAgent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiriAgent/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiriAgent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiriAgent/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiriAgent/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiriAgent/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiriAgent/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiriAgent/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #235\n\n## 摘要\n\n本 PR 将 A0 driver 接到正式发行的 installer、required prepare、installed public launcher 与 DIST-02 verifier，保留空 HOME、A0 专属凭据和最终 cleanup 的顺序。代码已实现并运行真实安装路径，但**完整五类 A0 尚未通过，当前不得合并关闭 #235**；需消费 [verifier PR #260](https://github.com/Pepgent/soroi/pull/260) owner 修订并公开的新 recipe/CI 后，从新空 HOME 整轮验证。\n\n## 实现说明\n\n- `A0Config` / `BootstrapConfig` / `parseA0` 与全部 caller 贯通 required `prepare:string[]`，缺失或空 argv 在创建资源之前拒绝。parent 将已解析的 campaign Build 原样写入 `/tmp/soroi-a0/build.json`，不从 artifact 文件名或 hash 推断运行 provenance。\n- `a0-bootstrap.ts` 使用 `/home/agent/.omp/agent` 作为 `PI_CODING_AGENT_DIR`，严格 real installer→prepare→installed `/home/agent/.local/bin/soroi --version`→同一 public launcher TUI→真实 verifier。parent 在 prepared barrier 前不发送 PTY steps；不使用 bare omp、source link 或第二个 installer wrapper。\n- 第一轮真实运行暴露 `docker cp` 保留 host UID、使0600配置对容器UID不可读。driver现在在token传输前查询本容器实际UID/GID，仅调整固定 `/tmp/soroi-a0` 暂存目录的owner，保持private mode，不改宿主文件或共享卷，也不把UID1000写成跨环境常量。\n- 失败前的 native proof 必须先于容器结束保存。`copyProof` 统一私有 staging→redaction→publication；`proofCopied` 仅记录本driver完成artifact copy的ack。失败时尚未复制的可用 proof 进入单独 `diagnostic-proof/`，明确partial/non-pass，capture错误追加原失败且不阻止cleanup。成功路径仍独立校验same-release Verdict、process exit与PTY EOF，最后才加入cleanup assertion并写root Verdict。\n- 使用说明同步到 `e2e/pty/README.md`。installer/prepare/verifier、五类 predicate、role/skill/rules/model credential topology仍由各owner维护，本PR不修改宿主或产品实现。\n\n## 变更预演（Layer 1）\n\n不适用——这是测试driver代码和文档变更，没有基础设施apply。实际A0仅新建本轮无状态IMG-01容器，复用已有S1网络/store/mux/gateway，全部资源先登记唯一OrbStack台账；不新建数据库、卷或网络。\n\n## 落地核对（Layer 2）\n\n当前head `99d8ed1a90e4f7561e47e296ae3b42c8595d2cd6` 已push，改动限 `e2e/pty/`。必需prepare、Build staging、corrected agent directory/public launcher、private staging ownership与失败proof生命周期均已落地。Commit/image/release字符串只作身份定位，不作正确性证据。\n\n完整原始失败、诊断、拒绝与native-input/API调查见 [固定PM归档](https://github.com/Pepgent/PM/tree/1c4988b1d2e4033f0835c59edeab48f750547db9/evidence/e2e/20261101T044721Z-a0-input-failures/F01)。原始PTY、D8 failure、cleanup、配置、probe与source excerpts原样保留；61个文件的直接保全比较与bounded scan只证明归档，不是产品正确性，不将初次失败改写为成功。\n\n## 启动 / 运行时顺序（Layer 3）\n\nHost Darwin arm64/Bun1.4.4，IMG-01 Linux arm64/Bun1.4.4。独立无凭据version-only容器实际 `omp --version` 得 `omp/18.14.2`、exit0并确认容器不存在；这只提供base runtime identity，不是A0。\n\n两个真实A0尝试均使用owner正式发布的 [CI41270217013](https://github.com/Pepgent/soroi/actions/runs/41270217013) tar与 [#235 recipe6553021595](https://github.com/Pepgent/soroi/issues/235#issuecomment-6553021595)，不是本地重建或source安装。实际入口：\n\n```sh\ne2e/pty/a0-install.sh /tmp/soroi-full-a0-88i7tuvp/campaign.json\ne2e/pty/a0-install.sh /tmp/soroi-full-a0-r2-36qhq4ut/campaign.json\n```\n\n- R1先记录真实tty与空HOME；bootstrap随后copy models报EACCES。容器UID/GID1000:1000、staged文件501:20/mode0600且不可读，直接证明输入owner不匹配。最终exit1，driver failure，cleanup true；未运行installer/prepare/TUI/verifier。\n- R2从新的空HOME整轮开始，ownership修正后实际installer安装118包、完成注册，真实prepare成功，public launcher version18.14.2与真实TUI均出现。完整prompt留在input editor，240秒内未观察到turn-end；最终exit1/driver fail/cleanup true，verifier没有运行。该输出不能确定具体submit机制，也不能证明模型绝无调用。旧success-only路径未保存R2 native proof，缺失记录没有被重构或借用。\n\n只读实际Mac native18.14.2 bundled JS确认：输入gate与CR/LF有两种source-supported解释，prepared/banner/2004h都不能证明composer可提交。现有公开CLI的唯一positional initial prompt仍走interactive TUI，并由host在await init后调用session.prompt。Main在读取D8-03/09并咨询两discuss后选择该既有入口，避免自造ready协议；它不覆盖F20/F21键盘义务。Linux运行尚待owner正式发布新recipe/CI后实际证明，不以Mac源码推断通过。\n\n## 端到端业务行为（Layer 4）\n\n### 已实际覆盖的driver拒绝与诊断路径\n\n- missing/empty `prepare` 两个真实 `a0-install.sh` CLI均exit1，未创建evidence/resources，没有fallback。\n- 实际执行真实installer与prepare后故意exit7的负例：\n\n```sh\ne2e/pty/a0-install.sh /tmp/soroi-a0-diagnostic-rejection-c0p2vox6/campaign.json\n```\n\n父CLI exit1、D8仍 `fail/[\"a0-driver\"]`；cleanup前保留的 `diagnostic-proof/prepared.json` 含实际public-launcher registry查询、home `/home/agent`、work `/tmp/soroi-a0/work`、observer路径，partial note与cleanup errors[]一并保存。它只证明失败proof生命周期，不能补回R2 native记录或成为category pass。\n- 实际 `bun run --cwd e2e pty-smoke` exit0：真实ShellIO、deadline、process exit7 vs PTY EOF0、fresh IMG-01空HOME gate、缺models时before-token staging failure与cleanup均观察到。该smoke不是full A0。\n\n### 完整五类产品路径：当前阻塞\n\n完整A0尚未通过。需 [#260 owner](https://github.com/Pepgent/soroi/pull/260) 正式发布修订prepare/steps与其CI artifact：public launcher保持真实TTY/interactive，flags后以公开`--`传入唯一exact prompt，只去旧末尾单个CR，删除原prompt-send，不重复用户轮次；不-p/no-ui/RPC，不sleep、不补按Enter。随后从新的空HOME完整重跑。\n\n最终必须在同一轮实际观察非空dry Program CallReport的21→42、按发行定义名派出的worker及实际model/systemPrompt与成功return、skill正文、五条rule注入、child personality:none、same-release category Verdict以及最终process/PTY/container cleanup。turn-end仅同步，不承担任何predicate。未达到这些条件前，不关闭235/224，也不把它们或full A0与 [F26–F30 live #259](https://github.com/Pepgent/soroi/issues/259) 混为一项验收。\n\n## 卫生检查与审查\n\n`bun run --cwd e2e check`完成，无报错。独立task:mid审查了minimal wiring与ownership边界；新增diagnostic probe的Docker exit1/absence歧义已修为成功exec才返回明确present/absent，原reviewer定向确认闭合。静态审查和CI均不替代尚未完成的full A0。\n\n## 分析\n\n真实R1/R2将失败边界分别收敛到private input ownership和初始TUI输入提交；它们没有提供五类通过结论。已修driver问题都保留原始失败，实际负例证明diagnostic copy不会提升失败为pass或跳过cleanup。剩余full-A0输入方法由正式owner recipe与新CI确认后，以全新一轮实际结果裁决；当前PR只供实现审查，不满足合并关闭条件。\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-01T04:54:49Z","updated_at":"2026-11-01T04:55:04Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"6bedb1a218faadf4fe803611cbef421e734f3f59","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Pepgent:test/235-a0-public-launcher","ref":"test/235-a0-public-launcher","repo":{"id":1366237810,"node_id":"R_kgDOUW8icg","name":"soroi","full_name":"Pepgent/soroi","owner":{"login":"Pepgent","id":327843718,"node_id":"O_kgDOE4p_hg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/327843718?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pepgent","html_url":"https://github.com/Pepgent","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pepgent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pepgent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pepgent/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pepgent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pe